cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Does Your Tokenizer Speak Cloud? A Controlled Study of Domain-Specialized Tokenizer Compression on Microsoft Technical Documentation"
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
# NOTE: author fields are PLACEHOLDERS pending human confirmation
